 lead: every independent pollster since late September has him up between 6 and 8 points, and averages cluster around 6 to 7 points. He has also dramatically outraised Sununu, $15.4 million to $4.2 million, though Republican outside groups have spent heavily to close the airwar gap.\n\nSununu is a strong recruit with deep name recognition from his family's political history in the state, and some national coverage suggests the race has tightened from earlier in the fall. Still, markets price Pappas at roughly 86 to 90 percent, and most expert ratings fall between Lean D and Likely D. The race is competitive but tilts clearly toward Democrats heading into the final weeks.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.8721, "margin": 5.76}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.8221, "margin": 5.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.7959, "margin": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.8661, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.8028, "margin": 5.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.837, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.8746, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.8609, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.856, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.8659, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.8767, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.8474, "margin": 5.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.8665, "margin": 5.8}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.841, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.8206, "margin": 5.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.8623, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.8967, "margin": 7.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.8462, "margin": 6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.8579, "margin": 6.5}]}